Patches applied to the deps/libdb submodule before building it.

None at present.  The libtool FreeBSD host-pattern fix this directory
carried for v2026.10.1/.2 (freebsd1* matching FreeBSD 10-19, so no
shared library was built) is upstream as of libdb v2026.10.3
(6e1f1c86a).

A patch here is named libdb-<pinned tag>-<topic>.patch, applies with
"cd deps/libdb && patch -p1", and is applied idempotently by
deps/build_libdb.sh.  Drop it when the pin moves past the upstream fix.

Note: in v2026.10.3 five build_windows/*.sln/*.vcproj files are stored
with CRLF line endings against .gitattributes' "* text=auto", so
"git status" in the submodule lists them as modified on a fresh
checkout.  Cosmetic; the build does not use them.
